- **🎁 Metadata API deploys grant ZERO implicit FLS — even to Admin** (unlike the Setup UI wizard). Proven: before assignment, the System Admin saw only **6 of 17** fields (the required ones); after the permission-set-group assignment, all 17 unlocked. → **Reproduce LIVE in the demo** — provable least-privilege, not a claim. Strongest single moment in the demo.
- **🎁 Required fields bypass FLS** — access is inseparable from object access; they can't appear in a permission set's fieldPermissions (this was the first deploy error). Granular-probe answer.
- **Design: two permission sets in a group** — `Loan Application Base` (operational) + `Loan Application Sensitive Financials` (financial PII), grouped as `Credit Analyst`. Rationale = separation of duties / need-to-know tiering (grant Base wide, Sensitive narrow). Be ready for "why split them?"
