**⚠️ Build gotchas to respect (these also = panel call-outs — see Talking Point #10):**
- **One pre-filter value per chunk** (1:N indexing keeps only one, no arrays) → design the tag taxonomy around single values, not multi-tags.
- **Filter VALUES are case-sensitive** (field names aren't) → enforce a lowercase convention, or filters silently return nothing (nasty to debug live).
- **Retriever filter expressiveness may be flat** (AND-only / OR-only) → don't design a filter that needs nested boolean until you've confirmed the retriever supports it.

> **Convention going forward:** every gotcha we hit gets logged in BOTH places — the build list (so it shapes the build) and the talking-points log (so it's a panel call-out showing we anticipated it).

